{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9000_situation", "source_sha256": "04eee66fd7450a58340c0b9b939a3e14e294bc188172cbe70fa167ef5a546f34", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影後", "zh": "写真工作　拍摄后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9000_place", "source_sha256": "9da5ea1e5639ad2d1d415e43df10c0664928ed4ff4fcc90c5509c62b7467dfe9", "ja": "夜の繁華街", "zh": "夜间繁华街", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9001_p", "source_sha256": "337ca73c693c505f9fcafde524d113f505fc174c979b3ff89ef9f6bf868f9a17", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影が終了。\n翼はテーマの『一途系女子』を演じたわけだが……）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄结束了。\n翼饰演了主题“一心一意系女子”，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8e786230dedeeaf67b3ed8dd1eceddc9d6c3bd39a82dd01b1b6423504475c842", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん♪\n早く会いたかったのに、撮影が長引いちゃって～。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生♪  \n明明想早点见到你的，结果拍摄拖到现在才结束～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "41c30c43be76a6fbfdacb95278302a1bd1a849b1846ac24250c3b312672d8463", "ja": "わたし、{$P$}さんのことを\n考えながら、今日もい～っぱいがんばったんですよ？", "zh": "我可是一边想着{$P$}先生，\n一边在今天超～级努力了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9004_p", "source_sha256": "d1b4aa24d7ea4b3901ccd6c3bdfdf3c492656216cbb305b12fd5890643190570", "ja": "（これは……『一途系女子』を続けているのか！？）", "zh": "（难道她还在坚持走“专一系女子”路线吗！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4c5bc92ae8963e8f9281150fbf3a7eeaa59db578f8183e01e9205482ab990034", "ja": "だから……がんばったご褒美くれませんか～？\n食事とかショッピングとか！　もちろん二人で……♪", "zh": "所以……能给我努力后的奖励吗～？\n比如一起吃饭、逛街什么的！当然是两个人一起……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9006_p", "source_sha256": "6ea0c1449e473dde93a127dd149a22b697257de6ea727cc638d21e6ede7e9ece", "ja": "え？　えっと、そうだな……。", "zh": "诶？呃，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9007", "source_sha256": "170fbe250155eb3f540252f0b4d4bead866650e550870fcceba1fa44a00047bb", "ja": "希望を聞いてみる", "zh": "问问看期望", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9008", "source_sha256": "c4bc5751bf7dae89bfd731d9999d9ec0c7a9076361567519053b50e45c85122d", "ja": "はぐらかしてみる", "zh": "试着敷衍过去", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9200_p", "source_sha256": "ff51752d4f62b21a02c4e2ceeef7b55fc3e597421c2c87cb6495f5d02cf63677", "ja": "確かに、今日は頑張ってくれたからな……。\n一応だけど、どんなご褒美がいいか希望は……？", "zh": "确实，今天你那么努力了呢……\n姑且问一下，你希望要什么样的奖励……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9201_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c7d7b79ce8f47a4ab2955dc80e5a841a2e6d936914d575ff7c3537c8d7f919d9", "ja": "やったぁ☆　{$P$}さん大好き♪\nじゃあじゃあ、一緒に考えませんか～？", "zh": "太好啦☆ 最喜欢{$P$}先生了♪  \n那么那么，要不要一起想想～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9202_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1487682f07dbe89c041830981dbabaae707fe1a69bdea9da73e7f8bacd0d3d85", "ja": "こうやって、ふたりで予定を決めるのって……\nなんか恋人みたーい！　えへへっ、うれしいな～♪", "zh": "像这样两个人一起决定安排……  \n感觉就像恋人一样！嘿嘿，好开心啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9300_p", "source_sha256": "ff51752d4f62b21a02c4e2ceeef7b55fc3e597421c2c87cb6495f5d02cf63677", "ja": "確かに、今日は頑張ってくれたからな……。\n一応だけど、どんなご褒美がいいか希望は……？", "zh": "确实，今天你那么努力了呢……\n姑且问一下，你希望要什么样的奖励……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9301_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f87b2f0a97a233f15ab713145a629ec0eac8dbb47c3e6cd5584df766b88c8d8b", "ja": "それ、わたしに聞いちゃいます～？\nもう……乙女心がわかってないなー。", "zh": "这个还要问我吗～？\n真是的……你根本不懂少女心嘛——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9302_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7d2817ab1b464b6a1c0e92c852bfc5553305a513bcb15fb1de994a7ccd162e8d", "ja": "今日がダメなら、また今度でもいいですよ？\nそのかわり……うーんと期待しちゃいますね♪", "zh": "如果今天不行的话，改天也可以哦？\n不过作为交换……我可要好好期待一下啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9500_p", "source_sha256": "4ae62d4e7f90c4e93fb7c91927c261915a013aa2c02fbbf0d89adc004de06bff", "ja": "うーん……ご褒美か。いくつか思いついてはいるんだが\n翼が喜んでくれるとなると、難しいな～……。", "zh": "嗯……奖励啊。虽然想到了几个，\n但要让翼感到开心的话，就挺难的了～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9501_016tsu", "source_sha256": "446d178c75cd0fc9a6113220a859c5244dbfc862b42acd8d40a544ea20615bca", "ja": "わあ～！　わたしのこと……\nそんなに真剣に考えてくれたんですか♪　じゃあ……。", "zh": "哇～！您居然这么认真地替我考虑……♪ 那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9502_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7339fc6692996b0bc694fafacff188fce33e3adfc2b915c22454d4a212fbffaa", "ja": "{$P$}さんがご褒美を決めるまで、\nここで待ってますね♪　えへへ、楽しみだな～！", "zh": "在{$P$}先生决定好奖励之前，\n我都会在这里等着哦♪　嘿嘿，好期待呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9600_p", "source_sha256": "4ae62d4e7f90c4e93fb7c91927c261915a013aa2c02fbbf0d89adc004de06bff", "ja": "うーん……ご褒美か。いくつか思いついてはいるんだが\n翼が喜んでくれるとなると、難しいな～……。", "zh": "嗯……奖励啊。虽然想到了几个，\n但要让翼感到开心的话，就挺难的了～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9601_016tsu", "source_sha256": "26e73ae8721e5f474946e9bddf0694c7a8e86f3ed97865e3298610b2953944f9", "ja": "なんか怪しいっていうか……。もしかして、\n悩んでるフリして、ごまかすつもりでしょ～！？", "zh": "总觉得有点可疑……该不会是打算装作苦恼的样子，蒙混过去吧～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_9602_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0e26201b465acfe8b99a9dfd6f5f0e4b2388f93da8ff7fd4b1f1da2903675d1a", "ja": "でも、今日は許しませ～ん！　いっぱいわたしのこと\n考えて……ちゃんと答え、聞かせてくださいね♪", "zh": "但是，今天可不会原谅你哦～！请好好想想我的事……然后告诉我你的答案♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
